+## 12. Reply for "how do I prepare my child for Christmas?" questions — Sam approved 8 Nov
+
+Something that helps a lot of children is a picture timetable for the day itself: the day in order, with a picture for each bit (presents, visitors, car, dinner, quiet time, bed). Go through it the night before and again in the morning, and if plans change, change the picture together. A "first this, then that" card and an "I need a break" card they can hand you can help too.
+
